WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.000
Agentic FilmOps: Autonomous Production Disruption Recovery for Film & TV

2
00:00:05.000 --> 00:00:15.000
Day 12 of Production: A sudden severe thunderstorm alert threatens critical outdoor filming on Scene 42.

3
00:00:15.000 --> 00:00:30.000
Instantly, Gemini-powered domain agents activate in parallel across Script, Weather, Location, Actor, and Budget systems.

4
00:00:30.000 --> 00:00:45.000
Real-time MCP tool invocations propagate through the live Resource Dependency Graph, analyzing cascading impacts.

5
00:00:45.000 --> 00:00:55.000
The Actor Agent negotiates with talent agency management, confirming cast availability in under 30 seconds.

6
00:00:55.000 --> 00:01:10.000
Constraint solvers evaluate trade-offs and present 3 explainable recovery options. Option A saves $79,800 and 3 hours.

7
00:01:10.000 --> 00:01:20.000
With a single Human Producer approval, autonomous execution coordinates call sheets, soundstages, and logistics.

8
00:01:20.000 --> 00:01:30.000
Incident resolved in minutes. Production preserved. Welcome to the future of agentic film production.
